## What to deliver

Sequence the cue up operation by operation — tempo and meter, the tracks and their
notes, the mix — rendering to check the piano-roll and waveform as you go, until it
matches the brief: a driving militaristic minor-key naval theme that builds and
loops cleanly, stereo, within the 8000 ms cap. When you are satisfied, stop: the
recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
